          "title": "DONE — user-verified in the GPU showcase across rounds 4-6 (\"perfect. all is ok\"), commits 7ff3b59 (rest-glow model + focus batch) and 319a349 (tuning). Final model: theme owns the glow COLOR (theme.glow; toasts deliberately use it, not their severity tone — severity under the accent bracket frame blended purple); the glow_size setting owns the AMOUNT via the scaled_glow chokepoint (Thin strength raised 0.5→0.75 so it is distinct from None on faint rest glows); interaction.control_rest_glow + PaintCx::rest_glow(radius) give every surface the rest halo. Coverage: Button all bordered variants incl. Secondary (REST_GLOW_RADIUS 12; hover 30→16; Ghost glows with its hover fade), Input, Toggle, Checkbox box, Select trigger, Pane, DockFrame, filled Row cards, styled ScrollRegion, Tag, Alert, Toast (radius 14). Deliberately flat: Ghost/Link at rest, unfilled rows, Choice option rows, Tabs strip, RailCell bare-icon rest, frameless ScrollRegion, layout shells, disabled. FOLLOW-UP in T014: SDF glyph glow so Icons can halo. Docs: widgets.md \"The glow model — who owns what\" + per-widget notes.",
          "description": "DONE — user-verified in the GPU showcase across rounds 4-6 (\"perfect. all is ok\"), commits 7ff3b59 (rest-glow model + focus batch) and 319a349 (tuning). Final model: theme owns the glow COLOR (theme.glow; toasts deliberately use it, not their severity tone — severity under the accent bracket frame blended purple); the glow_size setting owns the AMOUNT via the scaled_glow chokepoint (Thin strength raised 0.5→0.75 so it is distinct from None on faint rest glows); interaction.control_rest_glow + PaintCx::rest_glow(radius) give every surface the rest halo. Coverage: Button all bordered variants incl. Secondary (REST_GLOW_RADIUS 12; hover 30→16; Ghost glows with its hover fade), Input, Toggle, Checkbox box, Select trigger, Pane, DockFrame, filled Row cards, styled ScrollRegion, Tag, Alert, Toast (radius 14). Deliberately flat: Ghost/Link at rest, unfilled rows, Choice option rows, Tabs strip, RailCell bare-icon rest, frameless ScrollRegion, layout shells, disabled. FOLLOW-UP in T014: SDF glyph glow so Icons can halo. Docs: widgets.md \"The glow model — who owns what\" + per-widget notes."
