    {
      "id": "d5962a9a-2776-4bd9-a629-5d44f1e33a81",
      "phaseId": "99d19246-1ba9-4720-9895-e70c66acf144",
      "number": 13,
      "shortName": "focus-ring-polish-honor-focus",
      "title": "Focus-ring polish: honor focus-visible (keyboard-only ring), [appearance] toggle, control-only ring for labeled controls",
      "status": "done",
      "description": "USER REQUESTS (2026-07-16; all four proposals APPROVED by user): (1) focus ring only on keyboard navigation, not mouse click; (2) a setting to enable/disable the focus outline; (3) less intrusive focus overall; (4) Checkbox ring should wrap only the box, not the label.\n\n## BUILT 2026-07-16 (uncommitted, AWAITING USER GPU VERIFICATION)\n1. FOCUS-VISIBLE HONORED: new `Base::shows_focus_ring()` (component.rs, = focused && focus_visible — CSS :focus-visible semantics, single definition). ALL 13 ring sites now gate on it (button, badge_button, checkbox, icon_button, input, select, toast, tabs, toggle single-line; choice, item, rail_cell, row multiline). Mouse click still focuses (Enter/Space work, caret shows) but draws NO ring; Tab/arrow navigation (FocusManager::advance → focus_visible=true) rings. Regression test: focus_ring_shows_on_keyboard_focus_not_on_mouse_click (phase_a.rs).\n2. [appearance] show_focus_border SETTING: new Option<bool> field in AppearanceConfig (appearance.rs) + effective_show_focus_border(theme) resolver (config override → theme.show_focus_border), applied at the chrome_gui_theme() choke point (heca/src/chrome/mod.rs) so prefix+Shift+r live-reloads it; documented in config.default.toml [appearance] effect-token block (glow_size/intensity/show_focus_border).\n3. LESS INTRUSIVE = (1)+(2) combined; focus_border_width was already configurable for thinning.\n4. CHECKBOX ring now wraps box_rect() only (checkbox.rs) — the standard control ring; label stays clickable but un-ringed. Toggle reviewed: it rings its own track (no label) — already correct.\nDocs: widgets.md Base table focus_visible row rewritten, Theme table show_focus_border row added, Checkbox entry note. Workspace green, clippy clean.\n\nVERIFY (user, GPU showcase + app): click any widget → NO ring (but it activates/types); Tab / arrows → ring appears on the focused widget; checkbox ring hugs the box only; in the APP: set [appearance] show_focus_border = false + prefix+Shift+r → all rings gone (the showcase has no config file — the setting is app-side).",
      "notes": "",
      "statusLog": [
        {
          "id": "d5962a9a-2776-4bd9-a629-5d44f1e33a81-check-001-planned-in-progress",
